     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:small\">Hello,</span><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I released version 1.5.2 of STITCH a few days ago. Changes compared to 1.5.1 include the following</font></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">1. </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Capability to substantially decrease RAM usage when running with a large number of samples</span></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">2. Better error message when imputing few or no SNPs</font></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">3. Able to impute when only 2 SNPs, including 1 SNP in central region</font></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Details about release versions can be found at</font></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793245260267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YvPIs076Q9aezwG-0xgO7\">https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md</a></span><br></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Speed and performance benchmarks can he found at</span></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/benchmarks/summarize_benchmarking.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/benchmarks/summarize_benchmarking.md&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793245260267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xTELxHLTOZyR1f617K26u\">https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH/blob/master/benchmarks/summarize_benchmarking.md</a></font><br></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The repo is at</font></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793245260267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1j-jePNvdqaHvi35hhfjjG\">https://github.com/rwdavies/STITCH</a><br></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Best,</font></p><p style=\"font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Robbie</font></p><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div></div></div>"
